    "campaign": "DEC IG & FB",
    "caption": "Invigorating and refreshing, make this Iced Shaken Brown Sugar Espresso with Silcafe Roasted Coffee Breakfast Blend!\n\nA shaken espresso combines milk, ice, espresso, and your sweetener of choice (in this case, brown sugar). Prepared with a shaker and served over ice, it’s a great way to entertain and impress guests, or for your own pleasure! The milk adds a smooth, velvety mouthfeel that mellows down the strong espresso. Try making this delicious coffee creation as soon as you can — head over to #TheMarketplace and add all the items below to your cart!\n\nServing Time: 10 minutes\nYield: 1 serving\n\nIngredients\n1 cup Silcafe Roasted Coffee Breakfast Blend\nCold water\n2 tbsps. brown sugar\n1 cup ice \n½ cup whole milk\n\nProcedure\nGrind Silcafe Roasted Coffee Breakfast Blend beans to a fine powder. Fill portafilter with the ground coffee, and tamp it down firmly.\nFill espresso machine with cold water. Attach the portafilter into to the espresso machine. Place the espresso cup under the portafilter, then brew the espresso for 25-30 seconds.\nPour 2 shots of espresso and brown sugar syrup into a mason jar or cocktail shaker filled with ice.\nShake vigorously for about 20 seconds until the espresso is nice and frothy.\nPour the into a glass.\nHeat milk in a saucepan over medium heat until it reaches 70°C. Do not let it boil.\nPour milk into a tall container, and froth using a milk frother for about 20 seconds, or until very foamy.\nTop the espresso with frothed milk\n\n\n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/ShopNowGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
