    "categoryConfidence": "medium",
    "campaign": "DEC IG & FB",
    "caption": "Love grilled cheese? Then you’ll enjoy tucking into this Grilled Cheese & Tomato Soup Bake, which is the beloved sandwich’s soupier and saucier cousin.\n\nMade with Marby Super Loaf, this hearty baked dish comes oozing with all the comforting flavors of creamy, savory cheese and tangy and sweet tomatoes. This is a great idea to bring to a potluck dinner with friends or family. Best served fresh from the oven! Head over to #TheMarketplace and find all the items that you need to prepare this recipe.\n\nServing Time: 50 minutes\nYield: 4-5 serving\n\n\nIngredients\n\nTomato Soup:\n2 tbsps. olive oil\n1 pc. onion, chopped\n2 cloves garlic, minced\n1 ½ cup crushed tomatoes\n1 tbsp. tomato paste\n1 tsp. dried basil\n½ tsp. dried oregano\n¼ tsp. salt\n¼ tsp. black pepper\n3 cups vegetable broth\n\nGrilled Cheese:\n12 slices Marby Super Loaf\n6 tbsps. butter, softened\n2 cups shredded cheddar cheese\n2 cups shredded mozzarella cheese\n2 tbsps. basil leaves\n\n\nProcedure\nPreheat oven to 175°C.\nHeat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes. Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute more.\nStir in the crushed tomatoes, tomato paste, basil, oregano, salt, and pepper. Bring to a simmer and cook for 15 minutes, or until thickened.\nStir in the vegetable broth and bring to a simmer again. Simmer for 5 minutes more.\nSpread butter on one side of each slice of bread.\nLayer half of the Marby Super Loaf in a greased 9x13-inch baking dish, buttered side down. Sprinkle with half of the cheddar cheese and mozzarella cheese.\nPour the tomato soup over the cheese.\nLayer the remaining Marby Super Loaf slices over the soup, buttered side up. Sprinkle with the remaining cheddar cheese and mozzarella cheese.\nBake for 20-25 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.\nGarnish with basil leaves.\n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/ShopNowGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
