    "layoutCode": "FB3",
    "layoutName": "Caviar-Topped Deviled Eggs",
    "category": "RECIPE",
    "categorySource": "inferred",
    "categoryConfidence": "medium",
    "campaign": "DEC IG & FB",
    "caption": "Devilled eggs are a popular sight on canapé or appetizer spreads. Made with hard-boiled eggs, the yolks are hollowed out from the whites, mashed with other ingredients such as mayonnaise and mustard, and then stuffed back in. There are many ways to get creative with it, some even adding chives or crispy bacon bits.\n\nIn this recipe, we’re mixing the yolks with the traditional mayonnaise and mustard combination, plus a dash of paprika. We’re also transforming this humble egg snack into something a little more fancy by topping them with Emborg Black Lumpfish Caviar, which you can find at #TheMarketplace!\n\nPerfect as an opener for your holiday dinners, these Caviar-Topped Devilled Eggs are best enjoyed with a flute (or two) of champagne. Pinkies up!\n\nServing Time: 30 minutes\nYield: 5-6 servings\n\nIngredients\n6 large eggs\n3 tbsps. mayonnaise\n1 tbsp. Dijon mustard\n½ tsp. paprika\n¼ tsp. salt\n¼ tsp. black pepper\n\nFor the garnish:\n1 pack Emborg Black Lumpfish Caviar\n1 tbsp. Spring onions, chopped\n\n\nProcedure\nPlace eggs in a saucepan and cover them with cold water. Bring the water to a boil over high heat, then cover the saucepan and remove it from the heat. Let the eggs sit in the hot water for 12 minutes.\nOnce the eggs are cooked, drain them and rinse them under cold water until they are cool enough to handle. Peel the eggs and cut them in half lengthwise. Scoop out the yolks and place them in a bowl.\nMash the yolks with a fork. Add the mayonnaise, Dijon mustard, paprika, salt, and pepper. Mix until well combined.\nTransfer mixture in a piping bag with star tip. Pipe the yolk mixture back into the egg whites\nTo garnish, top each deviled egg with a teaspoon of Emborg Black Lumpfish Caviar. Garnish with spring onions.\n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/ShopNowGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
    "brand": [
      "Emborg"
    ],
