    "layoutCode": "FB5",
    "layoutName": "Chicken Parmigiana",
    "category": "RECIPE",
    "categorySource": "inferred",
    "categoryConfidence": "medium",
    "campaign": "DEC IG & FB",
    "caption": "This comforting and classic Italian-American dish is always a joy to tuck into.\n\nImagine a slab of deep-fried golden brown chicken that’s crisp and juicy, topped with a tangy and sweet tomato sauce, and smothered with Danes Easy Melt Shredded Cheese. Great for more romantic and intimate dinners, serve your Chicken Parmigiana with your favorite salad; or, if you’re feeling indulgent, a simple pasta tossed in some butter. Grab all the ingredients that you need for this recipe at #TheMarketplace, and throw in a bottle of white wine to go with this dish while you’re at it. Enjoy!\n\nServing Time: 45-50 minutes\nYield: 2 servings\n\nIngredients\n\nFor the sauce:\n1 tbsp. olive oil\n1 white onion, diced\n5 cloves garlic, minced\n3 cups crushed tomatoes\n1 tbsp. tomato paste\n1 tsp. dried oregano\n½ tsp. dried basil\nSalt and pepper to taste\n\nFor the chicken:\nCanola oil for deep-frying\n2 pcs. boneless, skinless chicken breasts\n½ cup all-purpose flour, seasoned\n1 large egg, beaten\n½ cup breadcrumbs, seasoned\n1 cup Danes Easy Melt Shredded Cheese \n\nProcedure\nHeat olive oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes. Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute more.\nStir in the tomato paste, and cook for 2 minutes. Add crushed tomatoes, oregano, and basil. Bring to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes, or until the sauce has thickened. Season with salt and pepper to taste. Set aside.\nPreheat the oven to 190°C. Preheat oil for deep-frying in a large skillet over medium heat. \nPound the chicken breasts to an even thickness. Season with salt and pepper. Coat with flour, then egg, then breadcrumbs. \nFry the chicken until golden brown on both sides, about 4 minutes per side.\nTransfer the chicken to a baking sheet lined with parchment paper. Top with sauce and Danes Easy Melt Shredded Cheese. Broil for 4-6 minutes.\n\n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/ShopNowGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
