    "caption": "Definitely not for an everyday dinner, but most definitely reserved for a special occasion, make this Chicharon Bulaklak Sisig in a matter of minutes with the help of Purefoods Chicharon Bulaklak.\n\nBring out your pulutan game and get cooking! If you’d like a healthier option, swap the pork belly for mushrooms and tofu for a lighter choice. Serve with some garlic rice and mayonnaise on the side for those who like a bit saucy. Of course, chilies and lots of calamansi are a must! Head over to #TheMarketplace and shop for all the ingredients that you need for this recipe!\n\nServing Time: 30 minutes.\nYield: 2-3 servings\n\nIngredients\nCanola oil for deep-frying\n1 (150g) pack Purefoods Chicharon Bulaklak, roughly chopped\n2 slabs pork belly, diced\n2 tbsps. margarine\n¾ cup onion, diced\n2 cloves garlic, minced\n4 pcs. red chili, chopped\n3 tbsps. soy sauce\n3 tbsps. calamansi juice\n½ tbsp. sugar\n1/4 cup mayonnaise\nsalt and pepper to taste\n2 tbsps. cup green chili, chopped\n2 pcs. calamansi, halved\n\nProcedure\nPreheat oil to 175°C. Deep fry Purefoods Chicharon Bulaklak until crisp and nicely browned. Do the same with the pork belly. Set aside.\nMelt margarine in a large skillet over medium heat. Add onion and garlic, then cook until softened, about 5 minutes.\nAdd half of red chili, soy sauce, calamansi juice, sugar and mayonnaise. Mix in fried Purefoods Chicharon Bulaklak and pork belly, then season with salt and pepper. \nTransfer to a sizzling plate, and garnish with remaining red chili, green chili, and calamansi.\n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/ShopNowGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
